/E (Dedicated and detail-oriented Production Pharmacist with 2.5 years of professional experience in the pharmaceutical manufacturing industry, specializing in production operations, manufacturing process monitoring, and compliance with pharmaceutical quality standards. Experienced in planning, coordinating, and supervising daily production activities, maintaining accurate manufacturing documentation, and ensuring adherence to Good Manufacturing Practices \(GMP\) and Standard Operating Procedures \(SOPs\). Skilled in production planning, workforce supervision, cross-functional coordination, and achieving production targets while maintaining product quality, safety, and operational efficiency. Possesses foundational exposure to Quality Assurance through industrial training. Committed to continuous improvement, regulatory compliance, and maintaining high standards of pharmaceutical manufacturing.)
